<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Assassination Rogue DPS Phase 4</h3>The top three trinkets for Assassination rogues this phase are all very close in performance. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50363/deathbringers-will">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deathbringer's Will</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50706/tiny-abomination-in-a-jar">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_alchemy_enchantedvial.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tiny Abomination in a Jar</span></a> are your Best in Slot options and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50343/whispering-fanged-skull">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Whispering Fanged Skull</span></a> is a very close third place. Considering how hotly contested the Deathbringer's Will trinket is, I would recommend aiming for Tiny Abomination in a Jar and Whispering Fanged Skull on an Assassination rogue.<div class="pad"></div>
